*.egg-info/
.env

# Sibling agent sessions use `git worktree add .worktrees/<slug>` (the hot-repo
# convention in the parent CLAUDE.md). Untracked, these are embedded git
# repositories, so a `git add -A` stages ANOTHER session's worktree gitlinks —
# and any file they have mid-edit — into your commit. Observed 2026-08-04 in
# video_analyzer_service; 11 of 19 w2v repos lacked this rule, all 19 had a
# worktree on disk.
.worktrees/
